            },
            "reviewBody": "This went fantastic over grilled fish and chicken. I made a whole grilled chicken, rubbing this butter under the skin. Really perked up the flavor. I took someone's earlier suggestions of adding minced garlic and red pepper flakes to this too.",
            "datePublished": "2005-02-25T11:20:07.827Z"
